Prices match Ledger when total purchase and sale prices preserve source decimal places.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager prices --sort date,account

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity ZEBRA
  format 1000 ZEBRA
commodity ALPHA
  format 1000 ALPHA
commodity Long_Fund_Name
  format 1000 Long_Fund_Name
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
account Assets:Funds
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains

2024-01-01 Purchase with integer amounts
  Assets:Funds  3 ALPHA {{1 SEK}} @@ 1 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -1 SEK

2024-01-02 Purchase with explicit decimal places
  Assets:Funds  3.0000 ALPHA {{1.00 SEK}} @@ 1.00 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -1.00 SEK

2024-01-03 Sale with integer amounts
  Assets:Funds  -3 ALPHA {{1 SEK}} @@ 2 SEK
  Assets:Cash  2 SEK
  Income:Gains  -1 SEK

2024-01-04 Sale with explicit decimal places
  Assets:Funds  -3.0000 ALPHA {{1.00 SEK}} @@ 2.00 SEK
  Assets:Cash  2.00 SEK
  Income:Gains  -1.00 SEK

P 2024-01-05 ALPHA 0.123456789012345678901234567890123456 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 ALPHA    0.333333 SEK
2024-01-02 ALPHA    0.333333333333 SEK
2024-01-03 ALPHA    0.666667 SEK
2024-01-04 ALPHA    0.666666666667 SEK
2024-01-05 ALPHA    0.123456789012345678901234567890123456 SEK
